# The GuC images XeProbe (docs/PROBE-MODE.md) builds in for stage 3 on the families IntelXe does not drive yet, pinned
# to linux-firmware tag 20261019: sha256, the path in linux-firmware, the GuC version its CSS header carries. Read by
# firmware/fetch.sh --probe (which downloads and checks them), kernel/IntelXe/build.py (which says whether each image
# it builds in is the pinned one) and kernel/IntelXe/tests/probe_css_test.cpp. Battlemage's image is IntelXe's own
# (fetch.sh, without --probe). Each is 320-390 KB; all seven add about 2.4 MB to IntelXe.kext.
